{"root":{"data":{"id":"dl28u5ia5r40","created":1788089528897,"text":"Color OS16系统"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptjgyo9s0","created":1788137439797,"text":"系统定义","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptw4otoo0","created":1788137467353,"text":"操作系统本质是硬件 和 应用程序（App）中间的一层管理者。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pw0ci7h40","created":1788137633261,"text":"引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pw4rzbq00","created":1788137642904,"text":"极光引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2px44bzpk0","created":1788137719838,"text":"转场动画连贯 “从哪来回哪去”，点击响应、滑动帧率稳定性提升；\n不只系统 UI，第三方 App 也接入这套渲染调度。","layout_left_offset":{"x":-57.99999956786644,"y":-9.999999925494194}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pwh8mlls0","created":1788137670032,"text":"潮汐引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pxdxynrk0","created":1788137741221,"text":"软件和手机 SoC 芯片深度协同，毫秒级动态升降算力，动画线程优先调度。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q08l2o680","created":1788137964650,"text":"繁星编译器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q0hrmla00","created":1788137984637,"text":"OPPO全新自研编译器通过业界独创跨级融合编译，大幅提升了编译语言的执行效率，\n助力系统响应更迅速、更流畅，让全价位机型都有顶级的流畅体验。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q3c08xdc0","created":1788138207190,"text":"Ai服务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q4saio280","created":1788138321004,"text":"小布助手"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q4vfd6540","created":1788138327827,"text":"小布助手使用全新唤醒方式及界面，提供更多的功能，\n从仅可以“听”和“说”的语音助手升级为能听得清、看得懂、还能帮你做事情的超级小布助理。\n开启小布后，可以通过语音查询天气、点外卖、发短信、打电话、定闹钟等。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q8qaaalc0","created":1788138630093,"text":"AI实景对话（下一个豆包）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q9cl2o2o0","created":1788138678634,"text":"接入DeepSeek"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q9s2i6x40","created":1788138712340,"text":"一圈既问"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qa9tntoo0","created":1788138750987,"text":"小布改算术"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qagxyh400","created":1788138766485,"text":"小布搜题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q6mhxl0g0","created":1788138465120,"text":"小布记忆"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q70usujk0","created":1788138496373,"text":"管理各个平台收藏种草的内容"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q7mzw4o80","created":1788138544570,"text":"同款大师参数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q7sekpzk0","created":1788138556342,"text":"小布记账"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q7y9hsm80","created":1788138569095,"text":"取餐码上云"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qbwdjb0o0","created":1788138878443,"text":"小布扫一扫"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qc29tyxk0","created":1788138891279,"text":"小布扫码识万物"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qcgzcij40","created":1788138923297,"text":"小布扫描解答"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qcohni3k0","created":1788138939641,"text":"小布扫描购物"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qcuv5ovk0","created":1788138953519,"text":"小布指令"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qe46wa400","created":1788139052184,"text":"自定义指令"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qe9365sg0","created":1788139062842,"text":"自动执行指令"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qf3dsv880","created":1788139128789,"text":"AI写作"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qf8c5z6w0","created":1788139139574,"text":"AI写文案"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qfcraccw0","created":1788139149195,"text":"AI回信息"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qftr1f4w0","created":1788139186185,"text":"仅支持微信、QQ、小红书"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qgt8rxwo0","created":1788139263445,"text":"AI图像助手"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qh146eow0","created":1788139280581,"text":"AI消除"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qi4no8g80","created":1788139366655,"text":"AI超清像素"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qidncif40","created":1788139386226,"text":"AI人像补光"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qj5u71y80","created":1788139447590,"text":"AI语音摘记"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qjf51sxk0","created":1788139467837,"text":"当你在看外语视频或上网课时，可使用字幕和翻译功能，帮助你轻松理解外语内容。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q3sz4hw00","created":1788138244127,"text":"跨端互联"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qjucz9ag0","created":1788139500969,"text":"设备空间"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qjvxt5yg0","created":1788139504405,"text":"设备空间是为管理与手机连接的设备而打造的控制中心。在设备空间中，你可以查看、管理所有与手机连接过的设备，如手表、电脑、蓝牙耳机等。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2ql8e4t680","created":1788139609878,"text":"与手机互联"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qlf58u6w0","created":1788139624578,"text":"镜像投屏","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qlk8c6c00","created":1788139635648,"text":"将手机屏幕镜像投屏到平板，在大屏上浏览手机文件及操控手机。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qlsvgvnk0","created":1788139654461,"text":"跨设备拖拽文件"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qlx2nhx40","created":1788139663603,"text":"在手机和平板之间通过拖拽即可传输文件"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qm117mdc0","created":1788139672223,"text":"平板和手机应用接力"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qmax3a2o0","created":1788139693742,"text":"手机上正在进行的应用进程，可以无缝切换到平板上继续使\n用","layout_left_offset":{"x":4.999999962747211,"y":-8.999999932944775}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qmpjvjts0","created":1788139725594,"text":"剪贴板同步"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qmt9fjhs0","created":1788139733670,"text":"手机和平板共享剪贴板，在一台设备上复制的内容可以直接粘贴到另外\n一台设备上使用","layout_left_offset":{"x":-74.99999944120646,"y":-6.999999947845936}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qmz96ezs0","created":1788139746715,"text":"拍照流转"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2qn2jpgrk0","created":1788139753882,"text":"手机上拍摄的照片、视频、保存的截屏、录屏可以实时同步保存到平板\n上","layout_left_offset":{"x":-87.99999934434891,"y":-7.999999940395355}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2qn9h7x3s0","created":1788139768969,"text":"通知同步"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}